{
  "name": "Potent Cantrip",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your damaging cantrips affect even creatures that avoid the brunt of the effect. When you cast a cantrip at a creature and you miss with the Attack Roll or the target succeeds on a Saving Throw against the cantrip, the target takes half the cantrip's damage (if any) but suffers no additional effect from the cantrip.</p>",
